      "hizbQuarter": 124,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2349,
      "text": "Tā Ha[1]",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 1,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 312,
      "ruku": 270,
      "hizbQuarter": 125,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2350,
      "text": "We have not sent down the Qur’an to you [O Prophet] to cause you distress,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 2,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 312,
      "ruku": 270,
      "hizbQuarter": 125,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2351,
      "text": "but as a reminder for those who fear Allah.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 3,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 312,
      "ruku": 270,
      "hizbQuarter": 125,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2352,
      "text": "A revelation from the One Who created the earth and the high heavens.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 4,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 312,
      "ruku": 270,
      "hizbQuarter": 125,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2353,
      "text": "The Most Compassionate rose over the Throne[2].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 5,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 312,
      "ruku": 270,
      "hizbQuarter": 125,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2354,
      "text": "To Him belongs all that is in the heavens and all that is on earth, and all that is between them, and all that is beneath the soil.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 6,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 312,
      "ruku": 270,
      "hizbQuarter": 125,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2355,
      "text": "Whether you speak loudly [or not], He surely knows what is secret and what is even more hidden.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 7,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 312,
      "ruku": 270,
      "hizbQuarter": 125,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2356,
      "text": "Allah – none has the right to be worshiped except Him. He has the Most Beautiful Names.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 8,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 312,
      "ruku": 270,
      "hizbQuarter": 125,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2357,
      "text": "Has there come to you the story of Moses?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 9,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 312,
      "ruku": 270,
      "hizbQuarter": 125,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2358,
      "text": "When he saw a fire, he said to his family, “Stay here. I have spotted a fire; I may bring you a flaming brand from it, or find some guidance at the fire[3].”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 10,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 312,
      "ruku": 270,
      "hizbQuarter": 125,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2359,
      "text": "When he came to it, he was called, “O Moses,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 11,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 312,
      "ruku": 270,
      "hizbQuarter": 125,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2360,
      "text": "Indeed, I am your Lord, so take off your shoes; you are in the sacred valley of Tuwā.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
